// A sibling module whose function divides by zero. The runtime error must render against THIS
// file's coordinates (line/column in models.lang), not the entry's — even though the failing
// declaration is merged into the entry program before running. This is the SourceMap behavior:
// a span carries the SourceId of the file it came from, so it resolves to the right source.
// (No `namespace`: this file sits at `Math.noe` in package `App`, so it IS `App.Math`.)

pub fn boom(): int {
    return 1 / 0;
}
